## FAQs

### What AV equipment do I need for a corporate meeting?

A gooseneck microphone for the boardroom, a projector and screen, and PA sound sized to a small group. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) cover these needs at different guest counts. See [A Board Meeting Is Not a Conference](#a-board-meeting-is-not-a-conference) above.

### How is a corporate meeting different from a conference?

A conference needs a large room and often breakout sessions running in parallel. A board meeting, client meeting or investor panel is smaller and more routine: a boardroom or hotel suite, a fixed speaker position, no breakout rooms. See our [audio visual rental for conferences](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-conferences/) guide for the larger case.

### Is a technician included for a corporate meeting?

Not by default on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/): a technician is available as an add on. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes a technician on site for up to six hours.

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a corporate meeting?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Basic MICE Pack up to the MICE Pack for a larger meeting, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### How many people can a corporate meeting AV setup accommodate?

The Basic MICE Pack covers up to 40 guests, and the MICE Pack covers up to 120. See [When to Step Up to the MICE Pack](#when-to-step-up-to-the-mice-pack) above.

### Do you provide video conferencing equipment for hybrid meetings?

No, video conferencing hardware is not part of our catalog. If your meeting needs a remote participant joining an in-person room, see our [audio visual rental for remote presentations](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-remote-presentations/) guide instead.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment for a corporate meeting?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
